  aciklama:
  - "Bu se\xE7iminde rengin <color=#FFFFE0>a\xE7\u0131k sar\u0131</color> {{isim}}.
    Do\u011Frular ve yanl\u0131\u015Flar aras\u0131nda ikilemde kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Y\xF6n duygunu yitirmeye ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F, seni hayallerine
    ta\u015F\u0131yacak ilham\u0131 k\u0131smen kaybetmi\u015Fsin. Se\xE7ti\u011Fin
    renk, dengelerin yeniden sa\u011Flanaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve hayat\u0131n sana
    daha g\xFC\xE7l\xFC bir el i\xE7in \"daha g\xFCzel kartlar\" da\u011F\u0131taca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    anlat\u0131yor."
